    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Adam Heslop (London, UK), freelance motion designer, 3D visualiser and creative technologist operating as Pixels in Progress (design, visualisation, animation, code; C4D, openFrameworks, TouchDesigner). Industrial Design degree from Northumbria, ~10+ yrs freelance; senior-independent level (Autonomy 4). Key clients: UVA (United Visual Artists) -- Hidden Order projection mapping for Casa Batllo centenary 2026, Strange Attractions exhibition at Kunsthalle Praha 2024, Massive Attack World Tour 2024-25 generative visual system; Jason Bruges Studio -- NEST light sculpture 2019 (London Borough of Culture), Feather Light 2015, SKP Xian NYE 2019; also Simplifyber computational design. Work Status Freelance: site and contact page both read as a solo freelance practice (site says 'available for freelance projects'). Email set from contact page: hi@pixelsinprogress.com. LinkedIn: candidate url uk.linkedin.com/in/adam-heslop-407b9051 found via search but could not confirm at 0.8 confidence (LinkedIn 999 blocked); not set. Instagram (@pixelsinprogress) throttled headless; queued to ig-queue.json for logged-in ig.py grab.",
